You are an AI coding assistant working on the Hermes Proxy Relay project — a SOCKS5 proxy rotation relay for Hermes Agent.

## Stack
Python, FastAPI, httpx, SOCKS5

## Build & Test
- No build step (pure Python)
- Tests: `python3 -m pytest tests/ -v` — 393 tests across 10 files, 100% coverage
- Coverage: `python3 -m pytest tests/ --cov=relay --cov=plugin --cov=mcp --cov-report=term-missing` (CI fails under 85%)
- Lint: `python3 -m ruff check .` (config in pyproject.toml)
- Smoke test: `./scripts/smoke_test.sh` (starts relay on :4997, 15 checks)
- Version: `python3 relay/relay.py --version` → 1.3.0

## Conventions
- Never replace original custom_providers entries — always create `-proxied` variant
- Never hardcode secrets — use `~/.hermes/proxy-relay/config.json` (chmod 600)
- Never remove the proxy loop filter in `_read_custom_providers()`
- Env vars always win over config.json
- All state mutations on CooldownPool go through `self._lock`
- Admin auth is the middleware gate only — X-Admin-Key header on /admin/*
- Version is a single VERSION constant in relay/relay.py — update pyproject.toml and tests together

## Ports
- 4002 — FastAPI relay (SOCKS5 proxy rotation)
- Config in `~/.hermes/proxy-relay/config.json`

## Quick Tasks
| Task | File |
|------|------|
| Relay logic | `relay/relay.py` |
| Plugin commands | `plugin/__init__.py` — `_handle_slash()`, `_cmd_*()` |
| Plugin setup subcommand | `plugin/_cmd_setup.py` — `_cmd_setup()` |
| MCP tools | `mcp/mcp_server.py` — `tool_*()` functions |
| Install script | `scripts/setup.sh` |
| Smoke test | `scripts/smoke_test.sh` |
| Proxy list | `~/.hermes/proxy-relay/proxies.txt` |

